      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt feel like a choice. it feels like a debt. every time i try to be better, i just see the same shadows coming back. honestly, sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the cycle—to make sure this pain doesn't just keep passing down to whatever comes next—is to just be the one who stops it. to make sure it ends here. does that even make sense?",
